ADDITIONAL CLAUSE — NO COMMERCIAL RESALE OF ACCOUNT ACCESS

This project is a personal-use bridge between a locally installed DeepSeek
Harness and the user's OWN WorkBuddy account. The authors do not authorize,
support, or permit:

  - reselling API access obtained through this bridge to third parties,
  - renting out, pooling, or sharing WorkBuddy accounts or credentials,
  - bundling this software into paid "relay" or "proxy" services.

Any such use violates this license. It also violates the upstream platform's
terms of service and may result in account restrictions. All consequences
(account bans, contract breaches, legal risks) belong to the person who
commits them, not to the authors or contributors of this project.
